introduction_en:
Super Dimension (Jiaxing) InfoTech Ltd. provides the whole-pipeline scanning equipment and solutions for the production of Hyperrealism Digital Human Assets. Founded in 2016, the company is a national high-tech enterprise. The company has developed series of products for various applications, covering the whole-pipeline 3D modeling technology and equipment in digital human assets scanning (body, face, skin texture and expression capture), including outdoor & indoor scene and object scanning.
- BodyCapture series as human body 3D scanning DSLR Camera Matrix;
- SuperCapture series as Light Stage for re-lighting and PBR texture scanning;
- PerformanceCapture series as 4D dynamic capture system;
- TextureScan series as PBR texture scanner. 
- ShapeX series as object 3D modeling equipment;
